# This project installs from the PUBLIC registry, whatever the machine says.
#
# A registry set globally in ~/.npmrc applies to every project on the machine,
# including this one. If that registry does not carry what this repo needs,
# `npm i` here spends its time on the wrong host and fails with ETIMEDOUT —
# a confusing failure, because nothing in the project asked for that host.
#
# Nothing here is private: the root package is `private: true` (it is never
# published) and every dependency it names is public. So the registry is stated
# in the project rather than inherited from whoever cloned it.
registry=https://registry.npmjs.org/
